{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach and grab it, check its properties, move and repeat. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = ObjectDetected    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    />",
